'''''Lyracystis''''' is an [[extinct]] [[genus]] of [[Cambrian]] [[eocrinoid]] [[echinoderm]].  The type species, ''L. radiata'', is known from several specimens from the [[Burgess Shale]] of [[British Columbia]], while ''L. reesei'' is known from a single specimen from the slightly younger [[Spence Shale]] of [[Utah]].  It is the type species of the [[Gogiida|gogiid]] family [[Lyracystidae]].

